sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    
    box "Tab 1: Online Banking (OLB)" #f0f7ff
        participant OLBApp as OLB App (Shell)
        participant WebComp as Robo Web Component<br/>(Rancher)
    end
    
    participant OKKK as OKKK (CIAM)
    
    box "Tab 2: Marstone App" #fff5e6
        participant NewTab as Marstone Tab
    end
    
    participant Auth0 as Marstone Auth0

    note over User, OKKK: Prerequisite: User is logged into OLB.<br/>OKKK Session Cookie exists in Browser.

    User->>OLBApp: 1. Clicks "Robo-Advisory" Banner
    OLBApp->>WebComp: 2. Load Web Component
    
    note right of WebComp: User views component content.
    User->>WebComp: 3. Clicks "Launch Marstone" Button
    
    note right of WebComp: Standard Window Open.<br/>Browser shares the cookie jar.
    WebComp->>NewTab: 4. window.open(Marstone_SSO_URL)
    
    note right of NewTab: The OIDC "Dance" Begins
    NewTab->>Auth0: 5. GET /authorize (OIDC Init)
    Auth0->>OKKK: 6. GET /authorize (Federated Login)
    
    note right of OKKK: Crucial Check: Browser sends existing Session Cookie.
    OKKK->>OKKK: 7. Validate Session Cookie (Silent)
    note right of OKKK: User is already logged in.<br/>Skip Password Prompt.
    
    OKKK-->>Auth0: 8. Redirect w/ Auth Code
    Auth0-->>NewTab: 9. Redirect w/ Auth Code
    NewTab->>Auth0: 10. Exchange Code for Tokens
    
    NewTab->>NewTab: 11. Load Marstone Dashboard
    NewTab-->>User: 12. User sees Marstone App (Tab 2)


